== Effect ==
* Doubles the invincibility frames Isaac gets after getting hit.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} This item makes it possible to use the {{M|Blood Donation Machine}} twice without taking damage the second time.
* {{dlc|nr}} This item makes it possible to use the {{M|Devil Beggar}} three times without taking damage the second and third times.
* The invicibility frames also get doubled when effects such as {{I|Holy Mantle}} are triggered, making it very useful for {{C|The Lost}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Mom's Box}} / {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{t|Blind Rage|r}}: Each copy adds +2 seconds of invincibility frames.

